# The synthetic DEMO ACCOUNTS (2026-10-15). Real Chin Hin Employee IDs DO start with "ZZ": the real roster has 65
# active SAG staff numbered X0001, ZZ-9001 ... -- so the prefix alone is never a gate (until today it was, in 12
