def review_team_calib_summary():
    """The AI insight on ONE person's performance for the person CALIBRATING them (Chris, 2026-09-28: "use the same
    line manager method by providing the overall AI summary + their score ... first"). Every line, the manager's
    remark once locked, their files -- the line manager's assessment, re-scoped. Only for someone in YOUR
    calibration scope (re-derived here, never trusted from the form), never yourself. Asked for per person by the
    calibration card, never inside a chat turn."""
