# AI+ Learning, phase 1 (2026-10-20; plan: OneHR/AI+ LMS/AI+ LMS plan 2026-10-20.md, canvas
# [design canvas link removed]). Its own module, all year, never a cycle's: the programme
# catalogue mapped to competency FAMILIES (tc_comp_key, never a title), what a person needs (their Career Plan's goals,
# the gaps their competency assessment showed, else what their job grows into next) with the programmes that build it,
# and the live learning-needs analysis (LNA) for L&D. Dark unless ONEHR_LMS=1, which only staging's .env sets: a
# signed-in person gets 404 from every /learning and /admin/learning page, a signed-out one goes on to sign-in (the
# deploy's route probe reads a redirect), the admin menu leaves it out and the dashboard keeps "Coming soon".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
LMS_KINDS = (("inhouse", "In-house"), ("external", "External"), ("elearning", "E-learning"),
             ("briefing", "Internal briefing"))
LMS_KIND_LABEL = dict(LMS_KINDS)
