# tables, the scoring rules. Staff call it "My Appraisal" / "Penilaian Saya" and never see "JG H"; admins, line
# managers, HODs and BU CEOs call it "Grade H Appraisal". Dark unless ONEHR_GRADEH=1, which only staging's .env sets:
# a signed-in person gets 404 from every path in GRADEH_PATHS, a signed-out one goes on to sign-in (the deploy's route
# probe reads a redirect). A cycle module `gradeh` on Year-End cycles only: it is NOT in CYCLE_MODULE_KEYS (six modules
# stay six; absence there means ON, and this one is OFF unless a row says active=1 on a Year-End cycle).
