#   /my-appraisal        the staff page (and its writes)        -> module "gradeh"
#   /review/gradeh       the line manager's journey              -> module "gradeh"
#   /calibration/gradeh  the HOD and BU CEO stages               -> module "gradeh"
#   /admin/gradeh        the super admin's pages                 -> never module-gated (/admin/* is not), gated here
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
